<%@ Page Language="C#" AutoEventWireup="true" CodeBehind="grideditor_tabeditablecell.aspx.cs"
    Inherits="FineUI.Pro.Examples.grideditor.grideditor_tabeditablecell" %>

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head runat="server">
    <title></title>
</head>
<body>
    <form id="form1" runat="server">
        <f:PageManager ID="PageManager1" runat="server" />
        <f:Grid DataIDField="Id" ID="Grid1" IsFluid="true" ShowBorder="true" ShowHeader="true" Title="表格（单击编辑）" EnableCollapse="false" runat="server"
            AllowCellEditing="true" ClicksToEdit="1" TabEditableCell="true">
            <Columns>
                <f:RowNumberField></f:RowNumberField>
                <f:RenderField ColumnID="Name" DataField="Name" HeaderText="姓名">
                    <Editor>
                        <f:TextBox ID="tbxEditorName" Required="true" runat="server">
                        </f:TextBox>
                    </Editor>
                </f:RenderField>
                <f:RenderField ColumnID="Gender" DataField="Gender" FieldType="Int" RendererFunction="renderGender" HeaderText="性别(不可编辑)">
                </f:RenderField>
                <f:RenderField ColumnID="EntranceYear" DataField="EntranceYear" FieldType="Int" HeaderText="入学年份">
                    <Editor>
                        <f:NumberBox ID="tbxEditorEntranceYear" NoDecimal="true" NoNegative="true" MinValue="2000" MaxValue="2025" runat="server">
                        </f:NumberBox>
                    </Editor>
                </f:RenderField>
                <f:RenderField Width="150px" ColumnID="EntranceDate" DataField="EntranceDate" FieldType="Date" Renderer="Date" RendererArgument="yyyy-MM-dd"
                    HeaderText="入学日期（不可编辑）">
                </f:RenderField>
                <f:RenderCheckField ColumnID="AtSchool" DataField="AtSchool" HeaderText="是否在校" />
                <f:RenderField ColumnID="Major" DataField="Major" ExpandUnusedSpace="true" MinWidth="150px" HeaderText="所学专业（不可编辑）">
                </f:RenderField>
            </Columns>
        </f:Grid>
        <br />
        <f:Button ID="Button2" runat="server" Text="保存数据" OnClick="Button2_Click">
        </f:Button>
        <br />
        <br />
        <f:Label ID="labResult" EncodeText="false" runat="server">
        </f:Label>
        <br />
        <br />
        快捷键说明：

    </form>
    <script>
        function renderGender(value) {
            return value == 1 ? '男' : '女';
        }

    </script>
    <template id="example-description">
        <section aria-label="页面描述">
            <p>让 Tab 只在可编辑的单元格之间移动，跳过没有编辑器或不允许编辑的列。</p>
            <h3><i class="f-icon f-iconfont f-iconfont-edit" aria-hidden="true"></i>跳过不能编辑的单元格</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>在<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control='<%= FineUI.Pro.ControlUtil.FindControl("Grid1").ClientID %>'
                        title="表格（单击编辑）">表格（单击编辑）</strong>打开一个文本编辑器，连续按 Tab，再按 Shift+Tab。<br />结果：焦点按正向或反向移到下一个可编辑位置，不停在静态展示列上，目标编辑器自动打开。</li>
            </ul>
            <h3><i class="f-icon f-iconfont f-iconfont-info" aria-hidden="true"></i>补充说明</h3>
            <p>非编辑状态可用方向键移动单元格；Enter 进入编辑，ESC 取消当前编辑。Shift 与导航键组合时按相反方向移动。</p>
            <h3><i class="f-icon f-iconfont f-iconfont-gear" aria-hidden="true"></i>关键属性</h3>
            <ul class="example-description-properties">
                <li><code>TabEditableCell</code>（<strong class="example-control-reference"
                        data-example-control='<%= FineUI.Pro.ControlUtil.FindControl("Grid1").ClientID %>' title="表格（单击编辑）">表格（单击编辑）</strong>）：初始为
                    <code>true</code>，将 Tab 的候选目标限定为可编辑单元格。
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </template>
</body>
</html>
